1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,583
The woman in the mask

2
00:00:01,583 --> 00:00:03,090
asks one question...

3
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:04,152
Am I pretty?

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,062
One legend calls her a samurai's wife...

5
00:00:08,062 --> 00:00:10,405
mutilated by a jealous husband.

6
00:00:10,405 --> 00:00:14,012
But that origin story has never been verified.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,551
What is documented?

8
00:00:16,551 --> 00:00:18,868
Japan, 1979.

9
00:00:18,868 --> 00:00:20,793
The rumor spread so fast...

10
00:00:20,793 --> 00:00:23,122
parents and teachers patrolled streets

11
00:00:23,122 --> 00:00:24,950
and escorted children home.

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,467
Some versions say:

13
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:28,068
Don't answer directly.

14
00:00:28,068 --> 00:00:29,719
The full story, below.
